iting biology if  partner seed points out something  interesting in a text book what skill  are you going to be performing well  you'll probably be reading biology and  because you're interacting you're  discussing main topics you're comparing  and contrasting different answers you're  defending your view from an opposing  view you are now interacting with  biology just like fly in the Germany to  try to understand and learn the German  language you know creating a new routine  is difficult a great example of that  happens every January come the New  Year's where people make a resolution to  join a gym and get in better shape and  so maybe the plan is work out two days  in a row Monday and Tuesday and then  take a day of rest and then two days in  a row Thursday and Friday they work out  and then they take a dare rest and week  one is going great and now week two  comes around you know they work out  maybe two days in a row but instead of  taking one day of rest  it stretches into three days of rest  instead of working out two days in a row  it's only one day in a row before the  day of rest come the third week the days  of rest are really taken over their  routine maybe they make the gym once  but then the days of rest become more  plentiful  Tim's around the world see this pattern  every January proving that a new routine  is difficult so please be supportive of  your student so parents guardians offer  some help be supportive your student  will likely need help as they adjust to  this new routine ways to be supportive  you can help organize study groups you  can offer your home you can offer to  drive your student to the low to the  gathering location you can perhaps  institute a positive reinforcement plan  where if your student meets the  agreed-upon criteria then there's some  sort of positive reinforcement for them  perhaps you can join in on the study  process now I'm not suggesting that you  join in the study group your student  would be mortified if you we